note """analysis check: dead nodes. The loop label IS targeted by a send, but the send is reachable only through the loop it feeds, so nothing outside the cycle ever enters it. A root rule that treats any targeted loop label as a root calls this whole chain live."""
flow orders
import "github.com/acme/billing"
import "acme.dev/flows/audit"
source ingest Poll
sink done audit.Store from ingest
loop retry
transform redo billing.Backoff from retry
send redo -> retry
